		     alternative, kept while both IdPs are alive. The label id MUST be
		     auth_drop_label: the hover handler derives the panel id from the
		     label id's first 4 chars (id.slice(0,4) + '_drop' -> #auth_drop),
		     and hideDropdowns() below lists #auth_drop explicitly. -->
		<li id="auth" class="dropdown coge-header-button noselect">
			<div id="auth_drop_label" class="dropdown-label" onclick="login_oidc();return true;">Log in <img class="dropdown-arrow" src="picts/arrow-right-icon.png" class="link"></div>
			<ul id="auth_drop" class="dropdown-menu hidden">
				<li class="dropdown-item"><a class="dropdown-link" onclick="login_cas();return true;">Log in with CAS</a></li>
			</ul>
		</li>
</TMPL_IF>
	</ul>
</header>
